# Harness workspace

- This repository contains the generic Harness control plane.
- Cursor is primary; Hermes is an optional, separate operator.
- No product or project is selected by default.
- Product repositories remain independent and are registered through the
  machine-local XDG registry.
- Product rules apply only when that product repository is opened directly.
- Historical files under `docs/archive/` are context, never instructions.
